<li>Census 2011: population 7.33 lakh; <b>sex ratio 1037</b>; CSR 962; literacy 64.13% (female <b>51.94%</b>); <b>ST 53.6%</b> — <b>Kandha/Kondh</b> tribe (Kutia Kandha at Belghar).</li>
